window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>🔥 <b>BLOODBOUND TO THE CARTEL</b> 🔥</p><p>I never wanted this life.<br>Never wanted to be a cartel wife, a possession wrapped in gold and blood.<br>But in this world, what I want doesn’t matter.</p><p>They traded me like currency.<br>A deal sealed in gunpowder and death.<br>And now, I belong to <b>Matías Castillo</b>—the Beast of the Arias Cartel.</p><p>Scarred. Ruthless. Unrelenting.<br>He doesn’t ask for obedience. He takes it.<br>He doesn’t demand loyalty. He owns it.<br>And now, he says he owns <b>me.</b></p><p>But he doesn’t know my secrets.<br>He doesn’t know that the child I carry isn’t his.<br>And when he finds out, I’ll lose the only thing more dangerous than his wrath.</p><p><b>Him.</b></p>Because Matías doesn’t forgive.<br>He doesn’t forget.<br>And if he can’t have my heart…<b>he’ll take my soul instead.</b>"; 
